# ==============================================================================
# AI-Powered Google Review Assistance SaaS — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# The customer-facing frontend application is built with React, Vite, and React Router.
#
# Production Note:
# During development, Vite proxies relative `/api/v1` calls to `http://localhost:3000`.
# In production, the built static files should be served behind a reverse proxy (e.g., Nginx,
# Cloudflare Tunnel) that routes `/api/` requests to the backend server.
#
# No client-side environment variables are currently mandatory.
# Any client-exposed variables in Vite must begin with `VITE_` and MUST NEVER
# include secrets, API keys, or private database credentials.
# ==============================================================================
